config MC001
	bool "MC001 residual-current detection module"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_MEGASENWAY_MC001_ENABLED
	select GPIO
	help
	  Enable the driver for the Mega-senway MastCurr MC001 residual-current
	  (leakage) detection module. Reports the TRIP state through the sensor
	  API with a SENSOR_TRIG_THRESHOLD trigger and runs the zero-calibration
	  sequence.
